                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "94359643",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198018192203",
                            "num_reviews": 14,
                            "playtime_forever": 12,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 12,
                            "last_played": 1624647403
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It is cheap, but the title should emphasize that \"Magical\"  The racket has neither the dynamics nor the shape of a squash racket.  The \"ball\" is very large and bouncy.  The back wall is dead.  That is, if the ball touches it, it goes out of play.  There is a little of the feel of a squash court, but in 2x2.5 meters, you really aren't going to move on the court as you would playing.\n\nEither Quash or Racket NX will be a better investment in my opinion.  They don't come any closer to a court experience, but they are more feature rich and functional.",
